f the Lost Ark","title_original":"","work_type":"film","year":1981,"country":"US","node_type":"work","is_center":false,"primary_image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceG9VzoRAVGwivFU403Wc3AHRys.jpg","image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceG9VzoRAVGwivFU403Wc3AHRys.jpg","person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap1","person_name":"Steven Spielberg","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}],"in_collection":null},{"id":"aw17","title_display":"The Day the Earth Stood Still","title":"The Day the Earth Stood Still","title_original":"","work_type":"film","year":2008,"country":"CA","node_type":"work","is_center":false,"primary_image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBgFSYmG5tb7GsZ3tHR0WNaWaxA.jpg","image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBgFSYmG5tb7GsZ3tHR0WNaWaxA.jpg","person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap305","person_name":"Scott Derrickson","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}],"in_collection":null},{"id":"aw60","title_display":"The Adventures of Tintin","title":"The Adventures of Tintin","title_original":"","work_type":"film","year":2011,"country":"US","node_type":"work","is_center":false,"primary_image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQZ3sLR1Fi63NMsNRbjm9q5qODJ.jpg","image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQZ3sLR1Fi63NMsNRbjm9q5qODJ.jpg","person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap1","person_name":"Steven Spielberg","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}],"in_collection":null}],"edges":[{"source":"aw35","target":"aw100","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The game's narrative features an older, semi-retired adventurer (Nathan Drake) coaxed into a final quest involving a long-lost family member, mirroring the themes of aging and legacy explored with Indiana Jones and his son.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw19","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The entire Uncharted series is heavily influenced by Indiana Jones, but this installment's globe-trotting race to a lost city in the desert (Iram of the Pillars) strongly echoes the franchise's core adventure formula.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw20","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"While a more dramatic and biographical film, its narrative of a perilous, all-consuming search for a mythical lost city in the Amazon jungle shares a foundational premise with Crystal Skull's third act.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw321","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The season's subplot involving a secret Russian lab in the American desert conducting psychic experiments during the Cold War thematically echoes the film's opening at Hangar 51 and the psychic powers of Irina Spalko.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw98","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"The character of Mutt Williams, with his leather jacket, motorcycle, and greaser attitude, is a direct visual and character homage to Marlon Brando's iconic portrayal of Johnny Strabler.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw99","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"The film's atmosphere of Cold War tension, pitting military force against scientific inquiry in the face of an otherworldly discovery, echoes the narrative structure of this Howard Hawks-produced classic.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw16","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"As the fourth film in the series, it directly continues the story and character established in the original trilogy, particularly 'Raiders'.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw17","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"The film's shift to a 1950s setting incorporates thematic and visual elements from classic sci-fi of that era, including alien visitors and Cold War anxieties, mirroring the tone of films like this one.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw35","target":"aw60","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"George Lucas and Steven Spielberg have repeatedly cited Hergé's comics as a foundational influence for the entire Indiana Jones series' tone of globetrotting adventure and discovery.","direction":"outgoing"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw35","aw35","aw35","aw35","aw35","aw35","aw35","aw35","aw35"],"influences":[]},"stats":{"total_connected":9,"influences_count":5,"influenced_count":4,"filter":"all","vault_count":0,"beyond_count":9}}